OL,3,ATurkish officials 'destroyed'
OL,4,Apro-opposition TV channel, owner tells
OL,5,ABBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FMahiroD_lu said that several of his
OL,8,Ffamily members were among those
OL,9,Farrested when the pro-opposition
OL,10,Fchannel was taken into government
OL,11,Fcontrol last month, adding that the
OL,12,Fallegations against him and Halk TV are
OL,13,F"completely wrong".
OL,15,FThe Istanbul Chief Public Prosecutor'
OL,16,FOffice said that two former news
OL,17,Fanchors of the channel were among the
OL,18,Fmost recent group of people detained.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
